    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go on wild expeditions</strong> \u2013 Take on weird and hilarious quests, from sewer diving to train heists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your treehouse base</strong> \u2013 Expand and decorate the treehouse with new rooms, furniture and crazy collectibles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic co-op fun</strong> \u2013 Play solo or with up to 4 friends. Climb, race, and explore together in open-ended missions and wild mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your raccoon</strong> \u2013 Unlock hats, accessories, and give your raccoon a name and look that fits your style.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wild expeditions with unexpected rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase a train, clean up a park, or dig through the junkyard for lost loot. Every mission brings surprises, goofy challenges, and new things to unlock \u2014 from tools and areas to cosmetic gear for your raccoon crew.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb, jump, and explore like only a raccoon can</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash piles, trees, rooftops \u2014 everything\u2019s a platform. Discover hidden paths and silly secrets in levels built for climbing and messing around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with friends in co-op mini-games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your pals and dive into quick, chaotic fun. From raccoon soccer to trash truck races, there\u2019s always something silly to do in these bite-sized games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your raccoon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a hat. Or ten. Mix and match outfits, colors, and accessories to give your raccoon some serious (or ridiculous) style.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go on wild expeditions</strong> \u2013 Take on weird and hilarious quests, from sewer diving to train heists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your treehouse base</strong> \u2013 Expand and decorate the treehouse with new rooms, furniture and crazy collectibles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic co-op fun</strong> \u2013 Play solo or with up to 4 friends. Climb, race, and explore together in open-ended missions and wild mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your raccoon</strong> \u2013 Unlock hats, accessories, and give your raccoon a name and look that fits your style.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wild expeditions with unexpected rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase a train, clean up a park, or dig through the junkyard for lost loot. Every mission brings surprises, goofy challenges, and new things to unlock \u2014 from tools and areas to cosmetic gear for your raccoon crew.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb, jump, and explore like only a raccoon can</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash piles, trees, rooftops \u2014 everything\u2019s a platform. Discover hidden paths and silly secrets in levels built for climbing and messing around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with friends in co-op mini-games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your pals and dive into quick, chaotic fun. From raccoon soccer to trash truck races, there\u2019s always something silly to do in these bite-sized games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your raccoon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a hat. Or ten. Mix and match outfits, colors, and accessories to give your raccoon some serious (or ridiculous) style.</p>",
